  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys"><head>ΠΗΛΕΥΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="434" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-434" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys">
            <note type="source">Clemens Alex. Strom. VI, p. 748. schol. Aristoph. Nubium v. 1419.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πηλέα τὸν Αἰάκειον οἰκουρὺς μόνη</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">γερονταγωγῶ κἀναπαιδεύω πάλιν.</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">πάλιν γὰρ αὖθις παῖς ὁ γηράσκων ἀνήρ.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Versum 2 attulit Trypho in Museo Cantabrig. I, p. 49. et utitur eo Aristophanes in Equitibus v. 1098.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ μὴν ἐμαυτὸν ἐπιτρέπω σοι τουτονὶ</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">γερονταγωγεῖν κἀναπαιδεύειν πάλιν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="435" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-435" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys">
            <note type="source">Aristophanes Avibus v. 852.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὁμορροθῶ, συνθέλω,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">συμπαραινέσας ἔχω,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">προσόδια μεγάλα</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">σεμνὰ προσιέναι θεοῖσιν.</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">ἴτω δὲ Πυθιὰς βυὰ τῷ θεῷ.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">ubi scholiasta, Ὁμορροθώ: Σοφοκλέους ἐκ Πηλέως, ἀντὶ τοῦ τὸ αὐτὸ φρονῶ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="436" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-436" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.nauck1889grc1:448">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXXI, 9. Σ. Π.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὸ μὴ γὰρ εἶναι κρεῖσσον ἢ τὸ ζῆν κακῶς.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="437" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-437" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.nauck1889grc1:454">
            <note type="source">Harpocratio in ξηραλοιφεῖν, Σ. Π.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ ξηραλοιφῶν εἶματος διὰ πτυχῶν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="438" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-438" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Aristophanis Equit. v. 1147. Σ. Π. [scrib. Ποιμένων ex codd.]</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Κημοῖσι πλεκτοῖς πορφύρας φθείρει γένος.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="439" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-439" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.nauck1889grc1:452">
            <note type="source">Stephanus in Δώτιον, Σ. Π.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Βασιλεὺς χώρας τῆς Δωτιάδος.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="440" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-440" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.nauck1889grc1:455">
            <note type="source">Stephanus, Κυκνίτις: ἧς ὁ Κύκνος ἐβασίλευσε. Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Πηλεῖ καὶ ἐν Ποιμέσι “ Βοὴν Κυκνίτιν.”</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="441" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-441" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.nauck1889grc1:456">
            <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 106. 13. Λιποψυχεῖν: Σ. Πηλεῖ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="442" xml:id="fragment-peleys-dindorf1893_grc1-442" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_peleys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.peleys.nauck1889grc1:453">
            <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 107, 30. Μὴ νόμισον: ἀντὶ τοῦ μὴ νομίσῃς. Σ. Π. καὶ “μὴ ψεύσον.” Locum alterum ex Peleo servavit scholiasta Aristoph. Thesmoph. v. 870.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Μὴ ψεῦσον, ὦ Ζεῦ· μή μ᾿ ἔλῃς ἄνευ δορός.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
